  "hints": [
    "Sine is smooth and its endpoint values match.",
    "The derivative has the same zeros as $\\cos(kx)$.",
    "Take $kx=\\pi/2$ in the open interval."
  ],
  "solution": "$f^\\prime=[$k]\\cos([$k]x)$, so $[$k]c=\\pi/2$ and $c=\\pi/(2\\cdot[$k])$.",
  "statement": "For $f(x)=\\sin([$k]x)$ on $[0,\\pi/[$k]]$, find the Rolle point.\n\n[__________]{answer}",
